{"id":"en_i-watched-them-love-her","title":"I Watched Them Love Her","titleEn":"I Watched Them Love Her","description":"Tessa survives being thrown from a building by Chloe, her adopted sister, only to wake up at fifteen with her life starting over. Rather than chase her family's affection again, she steps back. Chloe twists events and accuses Tessa of cheating, but Tessa stays composed and uses surveillance footage to expose the truth, which gets Chloe expelled. Tessa goes on to earn top grades and a Yale scholarship. Her family offers apologies, yet she keeps her distance, then departs for Yale by herself, resolved to build a life on her own terms.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-watched-them-love-her/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-watched-them-love-her/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Drama","Regret"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d522k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-watched-them-love-her_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d522k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-watched-them-love-her_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d522k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-watched-them-love-her_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d522k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-watched-them-love-her_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d522k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","download